        "why_justification": "The note names what the move buys: every feature that is Micaform only under house rule 7 (Intensity, retired from the rack at 4.3; the tape stage, retired at 4.2; the dual capsule blend), by the distinctive word of its draft row. The set moves with the audit: missing the 4.3 retirement drops Intensity, reading the 4.4 entry as current drops the tape stage. Entailed by: \"it names every feature that is `Micaform only` and every feature that is `rack only`\".",
        "tag": "core"
